      "created_at": "2024-06-12T13:44:32.271Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m listening to the Hellboy Masks game right now and the system’s working better for it than I’d have expected.  Kind of interesting to hear Masks being used for something with some action in it for a change rather than dwelling on teen angst, even if that’s what the game is meant to do.</p>\n<p>Think I’m going have to re-watch the movie though, it’s been so long I can’t recall the original plot or tell where things are diverging.</p>",
